@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

package "pool-control-plane crate（当前）" {
  component "lib.rs" as Lib

  package "member_disk" {
    component "model.rs\nentity + updates + invariants" as Model
    component "allocation.rs\nBLK bitmap" as Allocation
    component "event.rs\nexternal facts + intents" as Event
    component "ports.rs\nexplicit domain capabilities" as Ports
    package "service/" {
      component "mod.rs\nservice + object store\nSDB-first update" as Service
      component "client.rs\nclient + private messages" as Client
      component "reconcile.rs\nobject coordination decisions" as Reconcile
      component "operations.rs\nasync business operations" as Operations
      component "runtime.rs\nclient + one root poll loop" as Runtime
      component "error.rs\nservice errors" as Error
    }
    component "*_tests.rs" as Tests
  }
}

component "Pool / PoolManager\nnot implemented yet" as Pool
component "Future common runtime\nextract only after real duplication" as FutureRuntime

Lib --> Model
Model --> Allocation
Event --> Model
Ports --> Model
Service --> Model
Service --> Event
Service --> Ports
Reconcile --> Service
Reconcile --> Operations
Operations --> Service
Runtime --> Service
Runtime --> Reconcile
Client --> Runtime
Error --> Model
Tests --> Service
Pool ..> Service : future assembly through Client
Service ..> FutureRuntime : no dependency today

note bottom of Service
这些文件共同实现一个MemberDiskService
不产生第二个ServiceLoop或Reconciler对象
end note

note bottom of FutureRuntime
不是当前crate，也不是既定框架
第二个真实领域证明重复后再提炼
end note
@enduml
